  ["globe", "50%", "12%", 200, 48, "Website Penetration Testing", "Public-facing websites attract automated attacks first. Our website penetration testing examines forms, admin panels, file uploads, third-party components, and server configuration, so marketing sites and customer portals do not become the easy way into your environment."],
