  ["mobile", "88%", "88%", 352, 352, "Mobile Application Security Testing", 'Mobile apps carry risk on the device and behind it. We examine local storage, transport security, and the backend calls each app makes. Our <a href="/services/mobile-application-security-testing/">mobile application security testing</a> treats the app and its APIs as one system.'],
