        <h2 class="process__title" id="process-title">Our Penetration Testing Process</h2>
        <p class="process__lede">From defining your testing scope to verifying fixes, CipherTrivia's Bengaluru team follows a structured process with clear deliverables at every stage.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--signal" href="/contact/">Request a Penetration Testing Quote {{ arrow() }}</a>
