      <ol class="process__list" data-process>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Scope &amp; Plan</h3>
          <p class="step__text">We review your applications, APIs and infrastructure, then agree on testing objectives, access requirements, authorized targets and testing windows.</p>
        </li>
        <li class="step">
          <span class="step__marker" aria-hidden="true"></span>
          <h3 class="step__title">Test &amp; Validate</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Our security specialists combine automated scanning with manual penetration testing to validate vulnerabilities, investigate attack paths and assess potential business impact.</p>
        </li>
