          <h3 class="step__title">Retest &amp; Confirm</h3>
          <p class="step__text">Once your team implements fixes, we perform the included retest within the agreed scope and document which findings are resolved or require further action.</p>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

