      <h2 class="ihead__title rv" id="s1-title">Why Choose CipherTrivia as a Penetration Testing Services Company in Bangalore</h2>
      <p class="ihead__lede rv" style="--d:1">Many penetration testing companies hand over a scanner export. Our penetration testing services deliver validated findings, fix guidance, and a retest. Here is what you get when you work with us.</p>
    </header>

    <div class="ledger ledger--3">
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("cursor") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Manual Testing Comes First</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our testers work through your application logic by hand, because scanners miss broken access control, flawed workflows, and chained weaknesses. Automated scanning gives us coverage. Manual penetration testing shows what an attacker can actually do with it.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("doc-check") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Findings Your Team Can Act On</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Each finding in our penetration testing services report names the affected asset, how we exploited it, the business impact, and the recommended fix. Your engineers get reproducible detail. Your leadership gets prioritized risk in plain language they can take into a launch or audit discussion.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("present") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Developer Walkthroughs</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">After delivery, we sit down with your developers and walk through each issue. They see how we reached it and leave with remediation guidance they can apply in their next sprint, without waiting on clarifications.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("retest") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">One Retest Included</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Our published penetration testing services include a retest. Once your team implements fixes, we verify them and update each finding's status. You end up with evidence that vulnerabilities are closed, not an assumption that they are.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:1">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("user-shield") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">A Bengaluru Team You Can Reach</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text">Every stage of our penetration testing services, from scoping to questions during testing and walkthroughs, happens with our Bengaluru team. You deal with the people who tested your systems, which keeps context intact and decisions quick.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="ledger__cell rv" style="--d:2">
        <div class="ledger__head">{{ icon("lock") }}</div>
        <h3 class="ledger__title">Experience With Regulated, API-Heavy Environments</h3>
        <p class="ledger__text has-links">We have secured a banking API gateway, and the <a href="/case-studies/banking-api-gateway/">banking API gateway case study</a> shows how we scoped, tested, and reported on it. If you want to see how our findings and fixed guidance are read in practice, our published <a href="/case-studies/">case studies</a> show how we document and present results.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

